We implore the [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionist Party</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?] to support [+ marcher_candidate +] as a unity candidate against <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Imperial Sovereigntism</span>, arguing that together, the Unity Coalition can defeat the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalists</span>. [? if unionist_relation >= 50 : We also remind them of the history of cooperation between our parties, dating back to 4283. ?]


